---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
---

<article class="body-font text-gray-600">
  <div class="container mx-auto flex flex-wrap px-5 py-8">
    <h2
      class="title-font mb-2 text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl md:w-2/5"
    >
      Kickstarter Actually Pinterest Brunch Bitters Occupy
    </h2>
    <div class="md:w-3/5 md:pl-6">
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed">
        Taxidermy bushwick celiac master cleanse microdosing seitan. Fashion axe
        four dollar toast truffaut, direct trade kombucha brunch williamsburg
        keffiyeh gastropub tousled squid meh taiyaki drinking vinegar tacos.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex md:mt-4">
        <a class="go-to" href="/airport-transfers"
          >Detalles <Icon name="tabler:arrow-narrow-right" size={22} /></a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
